  "question": {
    "text": "The focal length of a thin convex lens for red and blue rays are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>96</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> respectively. Then, the dispersive power of the material of the lens is",
